translate english chapter_school_7ad34f0a:

    # n "おさぼり病を治すために、りこちゃんには厳しい罰が必要だな"
    n "To cure your slacking-off sickness, Riko, a strict punishment is necessary."

# game/story.rpy:350
translate english chapter_school_6b8bef32:

    # riko "すみません。こ、今度はテストがんばります"
    riko "I'm sorry. I-I'll do better on the next test."

# game/story.rpy:351
translate english chapter_school_ef7a391f:

    # n "さぁ罰だ。机に手をついて！"
    n "Time for your punishment. Hands on the desk!"

# game/story.rpy:352
translate english chapter_school_f3f5072c:

    # n "いいか、りこちゃんの成績が悪いから、罰を与えるんだ"
    n "Listen up. Your grades are bad, Riko, so you must be punished."

# game/story.rpy:353
translate english chapter_school_1f5089c7:

    # staff "早速ですけど、今からお願いできたら助かるんだけど、どうですか？"
    staff "I know it's sudden, but it would be a great help if you could start right away. What do you say?"

# game/story.rpy:354
translate english chapter_school_0d1faa6f:

    # staff "ええ数名。両親と連絡が取れなくて帰宅させたくても出来ないんです"
    staff "Yes, several. We can't reach their parents, so we can't send them home even if we wanted to."

# game/story.rpy:355
translate english chapter_school_f7ca9de3:

    # staff "では、教室に案内します。子供達の気がまぎれるなら、授業でも何でも構いませんよ"
    staff "Then allow me to show you to the classroom. If it takes the children's minds off things, lessons or anything at all is fine."

# game/story.rpy:356
translate english chapter_school_e4fa67b3:

    # n "先生と俺が教室へ入ると、とたんに子供達のおしゃべりが消えた。"
    n "The moment the teacher and I entered the classroom, the children's chatter died away."

# game/story.rpy:357
translate english chapter_school_1f869aa0:

    # student "きりーつ。れい。ちゃくせき"
    student "'Rise. Bow. Sit.'"

# game/story.rpy:358
translate english chapter_school_9f242638:

    # staff "今日から臨時でみんなを見てくれる○○先生です。先生の言う事をちゃんと聞くように"
    staff "This is Mr. ○○, who will be looking after everyone as of today, temporarily. You will all listen to what your teacher says."

# game/story.rpy:359
translate english chapter_school_e6721594:

    # n "俺の簡単な挨拶後、汚れた白衣の教員は”後はよろしく”と言い残し教室から出て行った。"
    n "After my brief greeting, the teacher in the filthy lab coat left the classroom with the words, \"The rest is up to you.\""

# game/story.rpy:360
translate english chapter_school_8ae01fe2:

    # n "それから１時間目、２時間目と手作り授業を進めた。"
    n "From there, I carried on with my hand-made lessons through first and second period."

# game/story.rpy:361
translate english chapter_school_d88ca410:

    # n "朝から一向に”あの教員”は俺の授業を見に来ない。"
    n "All morning, 'that teacher' hasn't come to observe my class once."

# game/story.rpy:362
translate english chapter_school_5a956249:

    # riko "ちょっとみんな聞いて。実はこの災害で心の病気になる人が出ている"
    riko "Everyone, listen. The truth is, this disaster has been causing mental illness in some people."

# game/story.rpy:363
translate english chapter_school_de4d8c25:

    # riko "そこで、この時間はみんなの心のケアをする事にした"
    riko "So for this period, we're going to look after everyone's hearts."

# game/story.rpy:364
translate english chapter_school_e160bf48:

    # riko "この目隠しをして、手は椅子の後ろで組んで"
    riko "Put this blindfold on, and put your hands behind the chair."

# game/story.rpy:365
translate english chapter_school_314771ff:

    # riko "先生が見てるから、ゆっくり深く深呼吸を続けて"
    riko "I'm watching, so keep breathing slowly and deeply."

# game/story.rpy:366
translate english chapter_school_731d919c:

    # riko "先生が見てて病気かもしれない子には、少し触れるけど、動かないように我慢してな"
    riko "As your teacher, I'll have to touch you a little to check for the illness. Be a good girl and hold still."

# game/story.rpy:367
translate english chapter_school_2e0d4b19:

    # n "全員がしっかり目隠しするの待ち・・教室のドアをゆっくり開いた。"
    n "I waited until every child was blindfolded... then slowly opened the classroom door."

# game/story.rpy:368
translate english chapter_school_82db8a93:

    # n "教室の子供達は全員大人しくしている。"
    n "All the children in the classroom sit quietly."

# game/story.rpy:369
translate english chapter_school_4f012b3b:

    # n "教室の子供達も俺の行為を不振がってはいたが、そこままだ○学生。"
    n "The children in class were suspicious of my conduct too — but they were only ○ schoolers."

# game/story.rpy:370
translate english chapter_school_c174a1a4:

    # n "～校内放送、望月りこさん、先生のところへ来なさい～"
    n "~School announcement: Mochizuki Riko, please come to the teacher's office~"

# game/story.rpy:371
translate english chapter_school_44c61590:

    # n "この前、教室で心の病気の検査したよね。残念だけどりこちゃん病気にかかってるんだ"
    n "Remember the mental health check we did in class the other day? I'm sorry, Riko, but you've come down with an illness."

# game/story.rpy:372
translate english chapter_school_eea623c1:

    # n "でも心配ないよ。先生は治療方法を知ってるから、治療してあげられる"
    n "But don't worry. I know the cure, so I can treat you."

# game/story.rpy:373
translate english chapter_school_bdb96b3f:

    # riko "どこか痛くなる病気ですか？"
    riko "Is it an illness that hurts somewhere?"

# game/story.rpy:374
translate english chapter_school_dd506fcd:

    # n "治療しなければ大変な事になるよ。死ぬ人も居るらしい"
    n "If it isn't treated, things will get very serious. Some people have even died."

# game/story.rpy:375
translate english chapter_school_307ef630:

    # n "変わった病気だから、りこちゃんの為にも秘密にしてあげる。この中で治療しよう。さぁ入って"
    n "It's a rare illness, so for your sake I'll keep it secret. We'll treat it in here. Come in."

# game/story.rpy:376
translate english chapter_school_68153a40:

    # riko "え、これ治療ですか？"
    riko "Huh? Is this some kind of treatment?"

# game/story.rpy:377
translate english chapter_school_261e4e8a:

    # n "そうだよ。りこちゃんの身体の為なんだ。急いで治療しないとね"
    n "That's right. It's for your body's sake, Riko. We must treat you right away."

# game/story.rpy:378
translate english chapter_school_76e5ea6d:

    # riko "先生、これ治療じゃないです"
    riko "Sir, this isn't treatment."

# game/story.rpy:379
translate english chapter_school_7af9af04:

    # n "教室でも一人で居る時が多くなっていた。"
    n "Even in the classroom, she spent more and more time alone."

# game/story.rpy:380
translate english chapter_school_cd3c213e:

    # teacher "治療は・・遅すぎた・・。死・・・心から・・・"
    teacher "The treatment... came too late... My death... I'm sorry, from my heart..."

# game/story.rpy:381
translate english chapter_school_89f8253c:

    # n "大丈夫。学校でも予防注射するだろ。それと同じだよ"
    n "It's all right. You get shots at school, don't you? It's just like that."

# game/story.rpy:382
translate english chapter_school_6425ac73:

    # n "この薬で、今までの１０００倍は気持ち良くなれるからね"
    n "This medicine will make you feel a thousand times better than you ever have."

# game/story.rpy:383
translate english chapter_school_26b78e20:

    # n "いた！別の教室で掃除をしていた、りこちゃんを見つけた。"
    n "There she is! I found Riko cleaning in another classroom."

# game/story.rpy:384
translate english chapter_school_dc3d28d2:

    # n "先日のテストの事なんだが、りこちゃんの点数がひどく悪かったんだ"
    n "It's about the test the other day. Your marks were terrible, Riko."

# game/story.rpy:385
translate english chapter_school_ac2ea25a_1:

    # n "実は前回のテストな。クラスで最下位だったぞ"
    n "The truth is, on the last test you were dead last in the class."

# game/story.rpy:386
translate english chapter_school_e36904af_1:

    # n "そうは思えないな、授業中何を聞いていたんだい"
    n "I find that hard to believe. What were you listening to during my class?"

# game/story.rpy:387
translate english chapter_school_9501b087_1:

    # n "授業中に、別の事考えてぼんやりしてたんだろう"
    n "You were zoning out in class, thinking about something else, weren't you?"

# game/story.rpy:388
translate english chapter_school_7ad34f0a_1:

    # n "おさぼり病を治すために、りこちゃんには厳しい罰が必要だな"
    n "To cure your slacking-off sickness, Riko, a strict punishment is necessary."

# game/story.rpy:389
translate english chapter_school_6b8bef32_1:

    # riko "すみません。こ、今度はテストがんばります"
    riko "I'm sorry. I-I'll do better on the next test."

# game/story.rpy:390
translate english chapter_school_ef7a391f_1:

    # n "さぁ罰だ。机に手をついて！"
    n "Time for your punishment. Hands on the desk!"

# game/story.rpy:391
translate english chapter_school_f3f5072c_1:

    # n "いいか、りこちゃんの成績が悪いから、罰を与えるんだ"
    n "Listen up. Your grades are bad, Riko, so you must be punished."

# game/story.rpy:392
translate english chapter_school_56a33365:

    # n "そうすれば、お兄ちゃんの病気が良くなるんだよね"
    n "\"And if I do, your illness will get better, right, big brother?\""

# game/story.rpy:393
translate english chapter_school_0ec7c547:

    # n "仕方ない！お兄ちゃんの秘密を教えよう。実は病気なんだ。しかもいろんな意味で重病だ"
    n "\"Alright, fine! I'll tell you big brother's secret. The truth is — I'm ill. And in more ways than one, it's serious.\""

# game/story.rpy:394
translate english chapter_school_6aea09f6:

    # n "でも、ゆりかが手伝ってくれるなら、お兄ちゃんの病気は少し良くなるんだ"
    n "\"But if you help me, Yurika, your big brother's illness will get a little better.\""

